# ── Takeover stabilization additions (2026-06-13) ──────────────────────
# Agent tooling / scratch that must never enter this repo.
# NOTE: gitignore only treats '#' as a comment at the START of a line —
# inline comments after a pattern become part of the pattern, so keep
# every comment on its own line.
# OpenCode harness node_modules + lockfile (~115 MB)
.opencode/
# Mavis scratch plans
.mavis/
# javac probe scratch
.javac_check/
# compiled probe build leftovers
probe-build.bak/
# prior recon run output
reports_takeover_recon/

# Compiled Java macro artifacts (commit the *.java source, not the *.class)
*.class
macros/**/*.class

# Runtime error logs not matched by *.log (e.g. starccm_gui_start.log.err)
*.log.err

# Regenerable solver / geometry binaries (commit the generator .py, not these)
Cases/
stl_samples/
scripts/*.stl
scripts/*.step
scripts/*.stp
scripts/*.png

# Timestamped V&V run outputs (the literal-path rules above never matched)
reports/*/[0-9]*T*Z/
reports/audit/*/[0-9]*T*Z/
reports/_*.txt

# ── 2026-06-13 takeover stabilization additions ──────────────────────
# Local workbuddy memory (per-project, regenerated each session).
# NEVER commit — these contain per-session state, not repo-wide facts.
.workbuddy/

# DEC-009 hollow-green exclusion: Rotor37Slice2D.java prints DONE and
# exits 0 while solving nothing (uses the dead
# AutoMeshDefaultValuesManager.setValue(double) path on 2402 R8, and
# the geometry is still an LDC placeholder). Committing it would
# mislead future readers. The 8 月期 real implementation lands in
# Rotor37SingleChannel.java (per DEC-008 §4 P0).
macros/Rotor37Slice2D.java
